OL,3,GNEWSAIt's A Sin star 'keeps you
OL,4,Aguessing' in Wales-set thriller
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's A Sin actor Callum Scott Howells
OL,7,Fsays his role in a new thriller, set
OL,8,Fand filmed in Wales, offers "exactly
OL,9,Fthe kind of challenge I love".
OL,11,FThe Night They Vanished, an adaptation
OL,12,Fof the novel by Vanessa Savage, also
OL,13,Fstars Welsh actress Gabrielle Creevy.
OL,15,FThe six-part mystery follows Anna
OL,16,F(Creevy) as she discovers her childhood
OL,17,Fhouse is listed on a trueb@Qcrime
OL,18,Fwebsite as the scene of her family's
OL,19,Ffuture deaths. While police say it's a
OL,20,Fhoax, Anna's family have vanished.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
